  "description": "This library contains enclave providers for .NET Framework applications using Always Encrypted with secure enclaves. An enclave provider implements the client-side logic for the attestation protocol and for establishing a secure channel with a secure enclave inside SQL Server. For details on Always Encrypted with secure enclaves, see https://aka.ms/AlwaysEncryptedwithSecureEnclaves.",
